## 2. Map data — CC BY-NC-SA 3.0

Applies to everything in `public/data/` and to `data/additions.json`.

`public/data/` is generated by `scripts/prepare-data.mjs` from the fan-made
Westeros GIS files, and is therefore a **derivative work** of them. It carries
the upstream licence, not the MIT licence above. `data/additions.json` holds
hand-placed points that are merged into the same output, so it travels with it.

Lineage: **Tear** (Cartographer's Guild) → **theMountainGoat** (2012) →
**cadaei** (QGIS shapefiles), obtained via
[mapbox/GOT-Inspired-Map](https://github.com/mapbox/GOT-Inspired-Map).

Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/

In short:

- **BY** — credit the lineage above. This app does so in its on-screen
  colophon; keep that intact in any deployment.
- **NC** — no commercial use. No selling it, no advertising against it, no
  paywall, no using it to promote a commercial product.
- **SA** — any modified or redistributed map data must carry this same
  licence.

