## 3. Fonts — SIL Open Font Licence 1.1

`assets/fonts/` contains Inter by Rasmus Andersson, under the SIL OFL 1.1. The
full licence text is in `assets/fonts/Inter-LICENSE.txt`. The SDF glyphs in
`public/glyphs/` are generated from those fonts and are covered by the same
terms.

